# Never commit working data from this directory.
#
# var/ holds crawled portal output and downloaded documents, including the
# per-meeting participant rosters (register list --json) and doc-contacts.json.
# That is personal data: it must never enter the tracked tree (repository rule).
# The Python pipeline source (meeting_report/, templates/, build_template.py,
# pyproject.toml) IS part of the skill and is tracked; only .venv/ and var/ are not.
.venv/
var/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
